# Input

```astro
---
import Button from './Button.astro';
import TextInput from './TextInput.astro';
---

<Button label="test button" />
<TextInput placeholder="enter text" />
<Ul><li>a</li><li>b</li></Ul>
<Body><div>content</div></Body>
<button>native button</button>
<input type="text" />

```


# Formatted

```astro
---
import Button from "./Button.astro";
import TextInput from "./TextInput.astro";
---

<Button label="test button" />
<TextInput placeholder="enter text" />
<Ul
	><li>a</li>
	<li>b</li></Ul
>
<Body><div>content</div></Body>
<button>native button</button>
<input type="text">

```
